    <name>Example ride - Barcelona coast</name>
    <desc>A sample route bundled with MeteoRide so the forecast can be tried without a file of your own. About 42 km, flat, out and back along the coast south-west of Barcelona, towards Castelldefels. Illustrative: generated, not a surveyed path.</desc>
